      "parent": null,
      "turn": 13,
      "speaker": "X",
      "kind": "message",
      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "Exactly. It challenges the notion of mathematical completeness. Do you think these limitations are only relevant to abstract mathematics, or do they have implications for practical computing and artificial intelligence?",
