      "parent": null,
      "turn": 16,
      "speaker": "Y",
      "kind": "message",
      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "Yes, and it also underscores the importance of heuristics and approximation in practical AI and computer science. Since we can’t always decide every question, we must rely on probabilistic or approximate methods for many problems.",
