      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "That’s an open question. Some researchers explore systems beyond classical logic, such as paraconsistent or fuzzy logics, hoping to circumvent some of these limitations. But so far, the core incompleteness results hold for any system rich enough to express arithmetic.",
